cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its composition study, please cite it as below."
title: "DiaFoot.AI: cascaded multi-task diabetic foot ulcer analysis"
abstract: >-
  A cascaded triage, segmentation and wound-measurement pipeline for diabetic
  foot images, together with a controlled study of how training-data
  composition affects segmentation quality across three architectures under
  five-fold cross-validation on leakage-controlled splits.
type: software
authors:
